                     <div class="flex min-w-0 gap-4 sm:gap-6 grid-cols-content">
                        <span data-count class="font-bold text-ghost text-big leading-none shrink-0">01</span>
                        <div data-fade class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                           <h4 class="text-h4">Cement tests</h4>
                           <span class="block h-px w-full bg-[#EDEDED] my-3"></span>
                           <p>Verify that cement on your site meets quality standards before it goes into your
                              structure.</p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <img data-fade src="~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle.webp" alt=""
                        class="w-full aspect-[4/3] sm:aspect-[16/11] lg:aspect-[5/3.6] rounded-md object-cover bg-[#E8E8E8]" />
                     <ul data-fade class="md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 lg:pt-2 list-none m-0 p-0">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Fineness test
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Consistency test
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Setting time test
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Concrete tests
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Slump test
                           (workability)
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Cube casting for
                           compressive strength
                        </li>
                        <li
                           class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium last:border-b-0">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Concrete temperature
                           measurement
                        </li>
                     </ul>
                  </article>

                  <article
                     class="grid items-start gap-5 sm:gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(220px,300px)] lg:gap-10 outer-grid-cols">
                     <div class="flex min-w-0 gap-4 sm:gap-6 grid-cols-content">
                        <span data-count class="font-bold text-ghost text-big leading-none shrink-0">02</span>
                        <div data-fade class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                           <h4 class="text-h4">Aggregate tests</h4>
                           <span class="block h-px w-full bg-[#EDEDED] my-3"></span>
                           <p>Assess the grading, cleanliness and moisture levels of sand and coarse aggregate used in
                              your concrete mix.</p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <img data-fade src="~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle.webp" alt=""
                        class="w-full aspect-[4/3] sm:aspect-[16/11] lg:aspect-[5/3.6] rounded-md object-cover bg-[#E8E8E8]" />
                     <ul data-fade class="md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 lg:pt-2 list-none m-0 p-0">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Sieve analysis
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Silt content test
                        </li>
                        <li
                           class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium last:border-b-0">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Moisture content test
                        </li>
                     </ul>
                  </article>

                  <article
                     class="grid items-start gap-5 sm:gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(220px,300px)] lg:gap-10 outer-grid-cols">
                     <div class="flex min-w-0 gap-4 sm:gap-6 grid-cols-content">
                        <span data-count class="font-bold text-ghost text-big leading-none shrink-0">03</span>
                        <div data-fade class="min-w-0 pt-1">
                           <h4 class="text-h4">Other tests</h4>
                           <span class="block h-px w-full bg-[#EDEDED] my-3"></span>
                           <p>Evaluate the suitability of water and other materials used across your construction
                              process.</p>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <img data-fade src="~/Assets/images/dummy-rectangle.webp" alt=""
                        class="w-full aspect-[4/3] sm:aspect-[16/11] lg:aspect-[5/3.6] rounded-md object-cover bg-[#E8E8E8]" />
                     <ul data-fade class="md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 lg:pt-2 list-none m-0 p-0">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Water quality testing
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Specific gravity tests
                        </li>
                        <li
                           class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-border py-3.5 text-p font-medium last:border-b-0">
                           <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>Density and absorption
                           tests
                        </li>
                     </ul>
                  </article>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>

   </section>

   <!-- SUPPORT -->
   <section id="support" class="scroll-mt-28 lg:scroll-mt-40 section-pb">

      <div class="container">
         <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start gap-6 lg:gap-10">
            <div class="rounded-md parallax-wrap lg:max-w-[62%] w-full">
               <img src="~/Assets/images/products/professional.webp" alt=""
                  class="rounded-md object-cover shadow-card parallax-img" />
            </div>
            <div class="lg:max-w-[38%]" data-fade>
               <div class="section-title-outer section-title-outer-start section-with-intro section-title-nonintro">
                  <span class="eyebrow-text">Technical support services</span>
                  <h2 class="text-h2 title-section reveal-text">
                     <span>Construction guidance</span> from engineers who have seen it all
                  </h2>
                  <p>Every construction site faces its own set of challenges — a concrete mix that is not setting right,
                     uncertainty around curing time, questions about which grade of cement suits a specific application.
                     Priya Cement's Technical Support Services puts a qualified engineer in your corner, offering
                     practical, site-specific guidance that helps you build right the first time.</p>
               </div>

            </div>
         </div>
      </div>

